#: ksystraycmd.cpp:61
msgid "No window matching pattern '%1' and no command specified.\n"
msgstr "Nema window matching pattern '%1' i nema navedene komande.\n"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:68
msgid "KSysTrayCmd: KShellProcess can't find a shell."
msgstr "KSysTrayCmd: KShellProcess ne mogu naći shell."

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:188 main.cpp:43
msgid "KSysTrayCmd"
msgstr "KSysTrayCmd"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:189
msgid "&Hide"
msgstr "&Sakrij"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:189
msgid "&Restore"
msgstr "V&rati na staro"

#: main.cpp:23
msgid "Command to execute."
msgstr "Komanda koja će biti pokrenuta."

#: main.cpp:25
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title.\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken. Not recommended!"
msgstr ""
"Regular expression (regularni izraz) koji se slaže s imenom prozora.\n"
"Ako ništa ne navedete, prvi prozor koji se pojavi će biti uzet\n"
"Ne preporučuje se!"

#: main.cpp:28
msgid "Hide the window to the tray on startup"
msgstr "Sakrij prozor u tray pri pokretanju"

#: main.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Wait until we're told to show the window before\n"
"executing the command"
msgstr ""
"Sačekaj dok nam nije rečeno da prikažemo prozor\n"
"prije izvršenja komande"

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "Sets the initial tooltip for the tray icon"
msgstr "Određuje početni tooltip za tray ikonu"

#: main.cpp:32
msgid ""
"Keep the tray icon even if the client exits. This option\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified."
msgstr ""
"Zadržava tray ikonu čak i ako se klijent ugasi. Ova opcija\n"
"nema efekta ukoliko startonshow je naveden."

#: main.cpp:34
msgid ""
"Quit the client when we're told to hide the window\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified and implies keeprunning."
msgstr ""
"Napusti klijenta kada nam je rečeno da sakrijemo prozor\n"
"nema efekta ukoliko je naveden startonshow i podrazumijeva keeprunning."

#: main.cpp:45
msgid "Allows any application to be kept in the system tray."
msgstr "Dozvoljava čuvanje bilo koje aplikacije u sistemskom tray-u."

#: main.cpp:64
msgid "No command or window title specified"
msgstr "Komanda ili ime prozora nije navedeno"

